00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:05.338 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-♪♪ Hold my gaze ♪♪

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:06.139 line:92%
-All right, here's how it works.

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:07.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
We're going to take turns
picking up a card

00:00:07.474 --> 00:00:09.943 align:start size:94% position:6%
