unblinking eye contact.

00:00:16.216 --> 00:00:18.218 line:92%
Now, if you laugh you lose.

00:00:18.218 --> 00:00:21.454
This is going to be -- This
going to be tough for me, okay.

00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:22.555 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay, well --
-Since you're my guest --

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:25.191
-We'll see how this goes.
-You'll be going first.

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:27.093 align:start size:94% position:6%
Go ahead and take a card.
-Okay.

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:28.328 line:92%
-And then when you're ready,

00:00:28.328 --> 00:00:30.964 line:92%
just read it to me and then say,

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:32.732 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Hold my gaze."
-Oh, man.

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:33.500 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Clears throat ]

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.469 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know, when I put my pants
on this morning,

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:39.072 align:start size:94% position:6%
the drier hadn't gotten them
completely dry yet.

00:00:39.072 --> 00:00:42.442 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're -- They're still damp.
I like it that way.

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:43.877 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Hold my gaze.

00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:48.281 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:50.984 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
